title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/workspace:open
catalog: GUI command
target: workspace:open
summary: Open a saved workspace here or in a new workspace

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``b ctrl+o`` → ``workspace:open new``
* ``ctrl+o`` → ``workspace:open here``
* ``i ctrl+o`` → ``workspace:open here``
